menuconfig SC32_DLNA
    bool "DLNA / UPnP renderer"
    default y
    help
        The device shows up as a DLNA / UPnP AV media renderer: control
        points (BubbleUPnP, Hi-Fi Cast, foobar2000, JRiver, Kodi, Plex /
        Jellyfin, ...) send it music from a media server or the phone.
        Plays MP3, AAC, FLAC, Ogg Vorbis, WAV, WMA and LPCM (audio/L16),
        seeks in files, plays gap-less (SetNextAVTransportURI).
        Can be switched off in the settings.

if SC32_DLNA
    config SC32_DLNA_PORT
        int "HTTP port of the renderer"
        range 1024 65535
        default 49152
        help
            Description, control and event URLs are served here
            (the web UI stays on port 80). SSDP uses UDP 1900.
endif
